  "label": "User projected onto the film set scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the film_set_scene, as the meme uses the visual of the film set and crew to represent the 'movie' being criticized. The text 'this movie sucks' and 'i am thinking of another shooting' implies the user (the creator or viewer) is identifying with the frustration of the filmmaking process, projecting their own experience or perspective onto the scene. The scene itself becomes the vessel for the user's emotional state.",
